Ground:Runner,desc:a tab that runs Books it is told — each Job stands a Desk and the Book's own Stands brings its code
  Stands:Story
  Main:Runner
  Role:runner
  Spine:Wire
  Spine:Ghost/Story/ErrchannelTesting.g
  Spine:Ghost/O/Supervisor.g
  Arrive:spine,of:Runner,stage:self,says:the runner's code is loaded
  Arrive:book,of:Story,in:Desk,by:StoryAt,until:finished,moves:run,stage:story,says:the Book asked for walks to its end
  Lift:spine
